flowchart LR
    subgraph UX[User interfaces]
        portal[React portal]
        api[FastAPI API]
        cli[Typer CLI]
    end
    subgraph APP[Application boundary]
        service[Platform service]
        normalize[Normalize and identity]
        policy[Common and provider policy]
        records[Request and proposal records]
    end
    subgraph PROVIDER[Provider boundary]
        aws[AWS adapter and modules]
        azure[Azure adapter and modules]
        state[(Provider state backend)]
    end
    subgraph REVIEW[Review and deployment boundary]
        bundle[Materialized proposal bundle]
        github[Manual GitHub validation and protected workflows]
        oidc[Short-lived OIDC identity]
        protected[Protected Environment]
    end
    portal --> api
    api --> service
    cli --> service
    service --> normalize --> policy --> records
    records --> bundle
    bundle -. operator publishes exact inputs .-> github
    service --> aws
    service --> azure
    github --> protected --> oidc
    oidc -. approved workflow only .-> aws
    oidc -. approved workflow only .-> azure
    aws --> state
    azure --> state
